<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">
  <PropertyGroup>
    <PackageType>Template</PackageType>
    <PackageId>OlimpiaIT.CleanApi.Template</PackageId>
    <PackageVersion>2.0.0</PackageVersion>
    <Title>Olimpia IT — Clean Architecture Web API Template</Title>
    <Authors>Olimpia IT</Authors>
    <Description>Template REST API con Clean Architecture, CQRS (Cortex.Mediator), Dapper+SqlKata, GenericRepository, Token Relay y Logger personalizado.

📖 Documentación completa: ver el enlace en https://dev.azure.com/olimpiait/SICOV%202.0/_git/BaseApi?path=/TEMPLATE_README.md

🚀 Instalación rápida:
dotnet new install OlimpiaIT.CleanApi.Template --nuget-source "https://pkgs.dev.azure.com/olimpiait/9fc7cbdd-2938-4c6e-be8b-989e9e378132/_packaging/sicovii/nuget/v3/index.json" --interactive

📦 Crear proyecto:
dotnet new olimpia-cleanapi --OrgName MiEmpresa --ProjectName MiProyecto

Incluye: Clean Architecture 4 capas, CQRS con Cortex.Mediator, Dapper+SqlKata, JWT Bearer (OpenIddict), Redis Cache, LogCentral, FluentValidation, paginación/filtrado/ordenamiento, 16 agentes GitHub Copilot y documentación técnica completa.</Description>
    <PackageTags>dotnet-new;template;webapi;clean-architecture;cqrs;dapper;sqlkata</PackageTags>
    <PackageProjectUrl>https://dev.azure.com/olimpiait/SICOV%202.0/_git/BaseApi?path=/TEMPLATE_README.md</PackageProjectUrl>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>v2.0.0 — Mejoras Gateway y correcciones Swagger:
- Gateway: split de configuración Ocelot en Configuration/ (un archivo por servicio downstream)
- Gateway: URLs downstream externalizadas en appsettings.json via MMLib.Ocelot.Provider.AppConfiguration
- Gateway: JWT passthrough configurable (AllowAutenticationValidator), CORS y feature flags
- Gateway: UseAuthentication + UseAuthorization y AuthenticationProviderKeys (Ocelot v23+ API)
- Swagger: corregido OpenApiSecuritySchemeReference para pasar 'document' (Swashbuckle 10 / OpenApi v2)
- Swagger: corregida clave de configuración Jwt:Providers:0:Authority en descripción del Bearer
- Docs: eliminado fragmento de código single-provider obsoleto de AUTHENTICATION.md
- Docs: actualizados ejemplos de configuración JWT a patrón multi-proveedor en CONFIGURATION.md</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <TargetFramework>net10.0</TargetFramework>

    <IncludeContentInPack>true</IncludeContentInPack>
    <IncludeBuildOutput>false</IncludeBuildOutput>
    <ContentTargetFolders>content</ContentTargetFolders>
    <NoDefaultExcludes>true</NoDefaultExcludes>
    <NoWarn>$(NoWarn);NU5128;NU5110;NU5111;NU5118</NoWarn>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <!-- Package README (se muestra en Azure Artifacts / NuGet.org) -->
    <None Include="..\TEMPLATE_README.md" Pack="true" PackagePath="README.md" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <!-- Template config -->
    <Content Include="template.json" PackagePath="content/.template.config/" />

    <!-- Source code -->
    <Content Include="..\src\**" Exclude="..\src\**\bin\**;..\src\**\obj\**" PackagePath="content/src/" Link="src/%(RecursiveDir)%(Filename)%(Extension)" />

    <!-- Tests -->
    <Content Include="..\tests\**" Exclude="..\tests\**\bin\**;..\tests\**\obj\**;..\tests\**\TestResults\**" PackagePath="content/tests/" Link="tests/%(RecursiveDir)%(Filename)%(Extension)" />

    <!-- Documentation and support files -->
    <Content Include="..\docs\**" PackagePath="content/docs/" Link="docs/%(RecursiveDir)%(Filename)%(Extension)" />
    <Content Include="..\scripts\**" PackagePath="content/scripts/" Link="scripts/%(RecursiveDir)%(Filename)%(Extension)" />
    <Content Include="..\specs\**" PackagePath="content/specs/" Link="specs/%(RecursiveDir)%(Filename)%(Extension)" />
    <Content Include="..\pull-requests\**" PackagePath="content/pull-requests/" Link="pull-requests/%(RecursiveDir)%(Filename)%(Extension)" />
    <Content Include="..\.github\**" PackagePath="content/.github/" Link=".github/%(RecursiveDir)%(Filename)%(Extension)" />    <Content Include="..\.specify\**" PackagePath="content/.specify/" Link=".specify/%(RecursiveDir)%(Filename)%(Extension)" />
    <Content Include="..\.vscode\**" PackagePath="content/.vscode/" Link=".vscode/%(RecursiveDir)%(Filename)%(Extension)" />
    <!-- Root files -->
    <Content Include="..\.editorconfig" PackagePath="content/" />
    <Content Include="..\.env.example" PackagePath="content/" />
    <Content Include="..\.gitignore" PackagePath="content/" />
    <Content Include="..\AI-FIRST-WORKFLOW.md" PackagePath="content/" />
    <Content Include="..\Dockerfile" PackagePath="content/" />
    <Content Include="..\nuget.config" PackagePath="content/" />
    <Content Include="..\Olimpia.slnx" PackagePath="content/" />
    <Content Include="..\README.md" PackagePath="content/" />
  </ItemGroup>
</Project>
